From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 08:14:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] address(v2): add the canonical x-only keyhash template

Type 1 carries BLAKE3(x-only secp256k1 pubkey), expands to DUP BLAKE3 PUSH32(hash) EQUALVERIFY CHECKSIG, and uses the existing 61-symbol address body/checksum. Keep type 0 bytes unchanged and reject unallocated types/extension escape. Add independent Python hash/root/address vectors and actual BIP340 ConnectOrdinaryBlock coverage. This adds an address template, not native wallet coin selection or a legacy script execution exception. Canonical specification: lotus-v2 monorepo d2b5f922.
